---
description: Require a tightly scoped review after code changes
alwaysApply: true
---

# Change-only review

- After modifying code, invoke the `change-only-reviewer` subagent before declaring the task complete.
- Give it only the current task's changed files and intended behavior.
- The review must use the current diff and must not review the whole codebase.
- Fix valid findings, then rerun only the relevant checks.
- Do not claim UI behavior from source inspection alone; verify the affected live UI when available.
